<title>USA: Louisiana-Pacific shuts two board plants.</title>
<headline>Louisiana-Pacific shuts two board plants.</headline>
<dateline>DUNGANNON, Va. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Louisiana-Pacific Corp said late Friday that it planned to close its oriented strand board plants in New Waverly, Texas, and Dungannon, Virginia.</p>
<p>The building products company, based in Portland, Ore., made the announcement after the New York Stock Exchange closed.</p>
<p>Normal production at the two plants ended Friday, but employees will continue to be paid through January 3.</p>
</text>
